## Append-only logs (importance-scored, cross-linked)

All entries below carry YAML frontmatter with `importance: 1-10`,
`captured: YYYY-MM-DD`, `tags: [...]`. New entries cross-link to entries
they refine/supersede.

- `what-works.md` — patterns / rituals that landed (Generative Agents importance scoring)
- `what-doesnt.md` — what bounced (low-information sibling of failures.md)
- `failures.md` — failure attribution with explicit *why* (Reflexion pattern)
- `decisions.md` — closed decisions, rationale, supersession links

## Consolidation history

- `DREAMS.md` — every `mh:agent:dream` pass leaves an entry: counts before/after, what was dropped/merged/promoted/enhanced, rationale.

## Chronology

- `../log.md` (sibling of `memory/`, not inside it) — append-only `## [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] kind | title` per session.
